  'ks3.nav.overview': 'Overview',
  'ks3.landing.eyebrow': 'Key Stage 3 · Years 7, 8 & 9',
  'ks3.landing.title': 'The full KS3 English curriculum',
  'ks3.landing.lead':
    'Years 7, 8 and 9 of secondary English mapped end-to-end. Yearly expectations, termly plans, weekly lesson frameworks, marking rubrics, skill progression and the British National Curriculum end-of-KS3 standard - all wired to The English Hub’s reading diagnostics, AI marking, and bilingual (English / Arabic) content layer.',
  'ks3.landing.arc_heading': 'The KS3 arc - Foundations → Development → Mastery',
  'ks3.landing.reading_progression_intro': 'Reading progression at a glance:',
  'ks3.landing.year_7_arc': '"This shows…" (identify + simple inference).',
  'ks3.landing.year_8_arc':
    '"This suggests… because…" (explain + multiple inferences + comparison).',
  'ks3.landing.year_9_arc':
    '"This suggests… which reflects…" (analyse methods across texts, conceptual interpretations, evaluation).',
  'ks3.landing.writing_progression':
    'Writing progression: Y7 control + basic structure → Y8 deliberate choices + clearer development → Y9 craft + conceptual depth.',
  'ks3.landing.three_years_heading': 'The three years',
  'ks3.landing.view_year': 'View Year',
  'ks3.landing.weekly_framework_heading': 'Weekly framework - the same 5 lessons every week',
  'ks3.landing.weekly_framework_intro':
    'Every week in KS3 follows the same shape so students build reflexes, not anxiety. Teachers adapt the text, the focus and the scaffolding; the framework holds steady.',
  'ks3.landing.lesson1_label': 'Explicit Reading.',
  'ks3.landing.lesson1_desc':
    'Teacher reads aloud, models pronunciation, assesses reading ability, teaches an analysis skill (R-focus).',
  'ks3.landing.lesson2_label': 'Reading and Discussion.',
  'ks3.landing.lesson2_desc':
    'Deepen understanding via sentence stems and structured talk (R + SL).',
