  'assessment.reading.download.note':
    'Note: This is a screening tool, not a diagnostic assessment.',
  'assessment.reading.download.date_label': 'Date',
  'assessment.reading.download.strengths_label': 'Strengths:',
  'assessment.reading.download.areas_label': 'Areas for Development:',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.title': 'Methodology',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.how_it_works': 'How the test works',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.how_it_works_body':
    'This screener uses graded passages of increasing difficulty (Year 3 to Year 13 level) to score reading comprehension and decoding from your answers, and records a self-timed reading rate.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.comprehension_body':
    'Measured through a combination of literal (retrieval), inferential (reading between the lines), and evaluative (analysis and judgment) questions on each passage. Both multiple-choice and short-answer formats are used.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.decoding_body':
    'Measured through word recognition accuracy, including both real words and pseudo-words (nonsense words that follow English phonetic patterns, similar to the Year 1 phonics screening check). This isolates decoding ability from vocabulary knowledge.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.fluency_body':
    'Reading speed is recorded as self-timed words per minute: the reader presses "finished" after each passage. Because nothing checks how accurately the passage was read, the rate is a rough indication only and does not feed into the reading age.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.standardisation': 'How the ages are calculated',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.standardisation_body':
    'The age tables in this screener are hand-built approximations written in the style of standardised reading tests - they are not standardised norms and carry no error margins. The reading age is a weighted composite of comprehension (two thirds) and decoding (one third), the two dimensions that are genuinely scored from your answers.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.basis': 'Methodology basis',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.basis_body':
    'The structure of the screener is inspired by established standardised reading tests including the NFER Group Reading Test, the Salford Sentence Reading Test, the Suffolk Reading Scale, and the York Assessment of Reading for Comprehension (YARC). The age tables here are approximations in the style of those instruments - they are not the published norms of any of them.',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.limitations': 'Limitations',
  'assessment.reading.methodology.limitations_body':
    'This is a screening tool, not a diagnostic assessment. It provides an indicative reading age that can help identify strengths and areas for development. For a formal diagnosis of reading difficulties such as dyslexia, a qualified educational psychologist or specialist teacher assessment is required. Results should be interpreted alongside teacher judgment and other evidence of reading ability.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.what_title': 'What this test measures',
  'assessment.reading.landing.what_subtitle':
    'An indicative screener of comprehension, decoding, and self-timed reading rate',
  'assessment.reading.landing.reading_age_body':
    'Your overall reading comprehension level, expressed as an age equivalent. Measures understanding of both fiction and non-fiction texts.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.decoding_age_body':
    'Your ability to recognise and decode words accurately, including real words and pseudo-words that test phonics knowledge.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.reading_rate_body':
    'How quickly you read each passage, timed by you. Reported in words per minute as a rough guide - it is not a measured skill level.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.how_title': 'How it works',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step1_title': 'Enter your age',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step1_body':
    'So we can compare your reading level to age-related expectations.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step2_title': 'Read graded passages',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step2_body':
    'Starting from simpler texts and progressing to more challenging ones. Your reading is timed.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step3_title': 'Answer comprehension questions',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step3_body':
    'A mix of multiple-choice and short-answer questions test your understanding at each level.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step4_title': 'Complete word recognition exercises',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step4_body':
    'Identify real words and pseudo-words to assess your decoding skills.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step5_title': 'Get your results',
  'assessment.reading.landing.step5_body':
    'Receive your indicative reading age and decoding age with detailed feedback.',
  'assessment.reading.landing.duration': 'Approximately 20-30 minutes',
