  'creators.success.body_pre':
    'We’ll review your application within 48 hours and email you with next steps. If you have any questions, contact us at',
  'creators.faq.h2': 'Frequently Asked Questions',
  'creators.faq.q1': 'What platforms can I promote on?',
  'creators.faq.a1':
    'TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, Twitter/X, blogs, WhatsApp groups - anywhere you have an audience interested in English revision.',
  'creators.faq.q2': 'How does tracking work?',
  'creators.faq.a2':
    'You get a unique referral link (e.g. theenglishhub.app?via=yourcode). When someone clicks it, they are tracked within the programme’s referral window. One programme, one set of terms; your dashboard shows your real verified earnings.',
  'creators.faq.q3': 'When do I get paid?',
  'creators.faq.a3':
    'Commissions are confirmed after a refund-protection period, then paid out via PayPal or bank transfer. One programme, one set of terms; your dashboard shows your real verified earnings.',
  'creators.faq.q4': 'Who can apply?',
  'creators.faq.a4': 'You must be 18 or over to join the partner programme.',
  'creators.faq.q5': 'Do I need a minimum number of followers?',
  'creators.faq.a5':
    'No strict minimum, but we look for engaged audiences interested in GCSE/IGCSE English. Quality matters more than quantity.',
  'creators.faq.q6': 'Do I need to disclose that it’s an ad?',
  'creators.faq.a6':
    'Yes. UK advertising rules (ASA/CAP) require you to include #ad in every promotional post. This must be clearly visible.',
  'creators.faq.q7': 'Is there a limit to how much I can earn?',
  'creators.faq.a7':
    'No cap. The more students you refer, the more you earn. Commission is recurring for as long as each student stays subscribed.',
