  'press.overview.eyebrow': 'About',
  'press.overview.title': 'A 60-second overview',
  'press.overview.p1':
    'The English Hub is an independent English learning platform designed for students, teachers and schools. The platform supports GCSE, IGCSE, KS3 and EAL English through structured learning resources, AI-assisted feedback, mock exams, reading and writing practice, teacher tools and school-level reporting.',
  'press.overview.p2':
    'The platform is exam-board aligned, not exam-board endorsed, and supports AQA, Pearson Edexcel, OCR, WJEC Eduqas and Cambridge IGCSE specifications. AI is used to assist drafting, formative feedback and resource generation; humans review what reaches students.',
