  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.lesson_builder.title': 'Lesson Builder',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.lesson_builder.desc':
    'Build structured, specification-aligned lessons in minutes. Add starter activities, main tasks, and plenaries with drag-and-drop ease, then share instantly with any class.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.ai_marking.title': 'AI Essay Marking',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.ai_marking.desc':
    "Students submit essays and get instant, detailed feedback aligned to your school's chosen exam board mark scheme. Review and adjust before it reaches them.",
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.analytics.title': 'Student Progress Analytics',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.analytics.desc':
    'Track every student in real time. Spot who is falling behind, who is excelling, and where the whole class needs extra support - all in one dashboard.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.homework.title': 'Homework & Assignment Manager',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.homework.desc':
    'Set assignments, track submissions, chase overdue work, and monitor completion rates across all your classes without juggling spreadsheets.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.library.title': 'Ready Resources Library',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.library.desc':
    'A growing library of worksheets, revision materials, model answers, and starter activities - all ready to print or share digitally.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.board.title': 'Your Exam Board, Your Content',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.feat.board.desc':
    'We support AQA, Edexcel, OCR, WJEC, and IGCSE/CAIE. Your school selects one board during setup and every lesson, resource, and mark scheme is tailored to that specification - so nothing is wasted.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.1':
    'Spend less time on routine planning and marking - the AI shoulders the repetitive work.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.2': 'Auto-mark homework essays in seconds',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.3': 'Generate worksheets and starter activities instantly',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.4': 'Get at-a-glance class progress without manual tracking',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.5': 'Predict student grades before exam season',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.6': 'Share resources across all your classes in one click',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.7': 'Eliminate paper-based marking admin',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.timesaver.8': 'Access the ready-made resource library any time',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.cost.q': 'How much does it cost?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.cost.a':
    'Every feature is free to try for 7 days with no card required. When you are ready to upgrade, the Teacher plan is £6.99/month or £67.99/year at the Early Access / Founding rate (planned standard pricing is £11.99/month or £99/year, and your rate is locked from the day you subscribe). Paid plans begin with 7 free days - cancel before day 7 and you are not charged. School plans are available through our Founding Schools Programme - £4,000/year for the first 10 schools, against a planned standard price of £8,000/year. Book a call to discuss.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.features.q': 'What features are included?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.features.a':
    'Every feature is available on the free tier with 3 uses per tool - AI Lesson Plans, AI Marking, Worksheet Builder, Student Progress Analytics, and more. The Premium plan removes all limits and gives you full access to the ready resources library, predicted grades, and complete exam board coverage. There are no add-on charges.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.boards.q': 'Which exam boards do you cover?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.boards.a':
    "We support all major boards: AQA, Edexcel, OCR, WJEC Eduqas, and IGCSE/CAIE. Your school selects one exam board during setup and all content - lessons, resources, mark schemes, and AI feedback - is tailored to that board's specification. You only ever see what is relevant to your students' exams.",
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.marking.q': 'How does AI Essay Marking work?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.marking.a':
    'Students submit essays through the platform. Our AI analyses the response against the mark scheme criteria for their exam board, provides detailed written feedback, and generates a predicted grade. You review and adjust everything before the student sees it.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.upgrade.q': 'Can I upgrade to a school plan later?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.upgrade.a':
    'Absolutely. If you want to roll The English Hub out to your department or whole school, visit our School Plans page or email us at info@Upskillenergy.com. We can migrate your existing data and give your colleagues instant access.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.free_tries.q': 'What happens when I use my free tries?',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.faq.free_tries.a':
    'Your 7-day free trial includes every tool - AI Lesson Plans, AI Marking, and Worksheet Builder. After the trial you can upgrade to the Premium plan at any time. Paid plans begin with 7 free days - cancel before day 7 and you are not charged. Cancel any time from your account settings - no hidden fees, no awkward cancellation calls.',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.startfree.badge': 'Start Free',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.startfree.title': 'Every Feature Available to Try',
  'mkt.teachers.ft.startfree.body':
    'No credit card. No time limit. Try each premium tool 3 times free and see the results for yourself before you pay a penny.',
