  'rev.texts.lotf.extract.intro':
    'How Golding stages the storm, the chant and the misrecognition that kills Simon - and how the scene carries the central thesis of the whole novel. Read the cards in order; each Notice points at something concrete, each Say tells you what to write about it, and each Zoom out places it in the bigger argument.',
